Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Legends of Sports Heroes: Dunk for Victories.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.52,0:00:16.80,Title,,0,0,0,,Obsession
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.16,0:12:36.96,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued…
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.52,0:00:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,In the previous episode, Wolffy encountered Victor, who was also trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They inadvertently learned the reason behind Blazey’s leg injury.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.68,0:00:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The two wolves joined forces to rescue the two elderly goats.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.44,0:00:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, facing the steadily advancing Vera,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.72,0:00:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,the little goats rallied with everyone’s encouragement and broke the deadlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.20,0:00:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s ride this momentum and tie the score!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.75,0:00:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.64,0:00:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,With this momentum, they can definitely turn the game around.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.72,0:00:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, we’ll keep our promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.00,0:00:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re waiting for you to bring them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.92,0:00:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Report: Detonation successful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.76,0:00:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The cave collapsed; none of the enemies survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.44,0:01:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The cave has collapsed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.88,0:01:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Your coach and village chief are both buried inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.20,0:01:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy, Coach…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.24,0:01:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If you withdraw from the competition now, you might still be able to save them in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.36,0:01:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You’ve lost your heart for the competition, haven’t you? The Goat Clan is just so fragile.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.60,0:01:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll be back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.48,0:01:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They’ll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.64,0:01:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy never gives up, no matter what difficulties he faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.00,0:01:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He always keeps his word.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.40,0:01:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We believe in Wolffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.20,0:01:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.88,0:01:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re all so heartless.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.12,0:02:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.48,0:02:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,…will definitely bring Mr. Slowy and Coach back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.24,0:02:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Defenders has finally narrowed the gap to under ten points.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, look! the little goats are amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.16,0:02:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what a team that beat us should look like.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.00,0:02:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We…will definitely keep our promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.84,0:02:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everyone okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.52,0:02:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, let’s hurry…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.40,0:02:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t run!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.72,0:02:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There are still more of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.52,0:02:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t…don’t…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.40,0:02:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t…run.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.28,0:02:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally found you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.12,0:02:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Auntie Goat!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.16,0:02:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you find this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.64,0:02:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough talk—hurry to the court!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.00,0:03:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Report: they…they’ve escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.80,0:03:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Shift…to max power, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.24,0:03:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.08,0:03:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.68,0:03:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s as if Team Wolves’ abilities have leveled up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.84,0:03:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Could they be evolving right in the middle of the match?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.20,0:03:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t let her succeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.52,0:03:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.48,0:04:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.56,0:04:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Jonie, the ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.64,0:04:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.20,0:04:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.68,0:04:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I won’t let you score.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.24,0:04:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,A fadeaway jump shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.96,0:04:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, come out…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.24,0:04:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.72,0:04:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.60,0:04:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t step on our team flag; it represents my family’s honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.52,0:04:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So, this is Team Wolves’ flag?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.56,0:04:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it was just a dirty rug.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.96,0:05:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.92,0:05:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that ever since their captain lost the match,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.84,0:05:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,he’s been locking himself in his room, too ashamed to face anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.36,0:05:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s just too fragile.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.20,0:05:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They couldn’t even win the championship; what honor do they have left?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.76,0:05:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,They’re losing Wolf Clan’s face.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.84,0:05:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, my family’s honor…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.28,0:05:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be the one to reclaim it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.28,0:05:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sorry, I committed a foul.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.04,0:05:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t mean to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.52,0:05:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.49,0:05:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Your eyes…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.16,0:05:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You clearly did that on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.80,0:06:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I…I’m fine…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.08,0:06:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re injured like this…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.88,0:06:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I can still keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.68,0:06:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised Wolffy we’d wait for his return.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.20,0:06:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Vera, you’re despicable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.24,0:06:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Despicable?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.52,0:06:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve done far worse things for the sake of the championship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.60,0:06:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I took precautions against every team that posed even the slightest threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.60,0:06:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But the one thing I never expected
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.64,0:06:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,was that my final opponent would be a weakling team like Goat Clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.44,0:06:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Vera, we will definitely defeat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.36,0:06:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.28,0:06:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi, catch the ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.16,0:07:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,With an eye injury like that, it would be a miracle if the shot went in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.80,0:07:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like Paddi has no choice but to pass the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.32,0:07:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s okay; I’ve practiced three-pointers countless times.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.64,0:07:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I’m using only one eye…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.72,0:07:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.04,0:07:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.36,0:07:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to make this shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.84,0:07:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,A three-pointer! Paddi actually sank it despite the injury.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.52,0:07:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And they’ve taken the lead!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.28,0:07:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the first time Team Defenders has led in this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.96,0:07:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Great play!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.04,0:07:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.52,0:07:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Defenders have taken the lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.28,0:08:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like Vera just doesn’t have what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.28,0:08:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Her skills are just too poor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.20,0:08:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Her skills are too poor. Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.84,0:08:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.36,0:08:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,She’s so weak, yet she talks about winning the championship.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.96,0:08:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Back in the day, her brother couldn’t win a single championship.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.00,0:08:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And they call themselves a basketball family. They’re losing Wolf Clan’s all face.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.56,0:08:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.76,0:08:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to win the championship for my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.56,0:08:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to reclaim the honor that belongs to our family.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.24,0:08:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.77,0:08:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I still unable to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.48,0:08:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Vera.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.56,0:08:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.24,0:08:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should just leave it at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.12,0:08:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I’ll take a break before practicing again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.20,0:08:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What I mean is, given your talent,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.80,0:08:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter how hard you try, you won’t play basketball well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.40,0:08:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You might as well…give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.52,0:08:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give up! You don’t have the talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.24,0:08:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You can’t do it. Give up. It’s just not meant to be…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.64,0:09:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? Why? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.40,0:09:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve worked so hard; why can’t I win?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.44,0:09:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to give up, even if I can’t get on the court to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.76,0:09:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I have to use any means necessary,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.92,0:09:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I will win this basketball championship for my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.36,0:09:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to make this shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.04,0:09:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This game…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.88,0:09:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I absolutely have to
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.52,0:09:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,win!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.76,0:09:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Defend!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.36,0:09:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m going to make everyone who looked down on my brother shut their mouths.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.84,0:09:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m staking everything on this shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.28,0:09:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think…you can stop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.28,0:09:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s…it’s a tie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.96,0:10:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Wolves has tied the score.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.52,0:10:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Vera!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.20,0:10:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Vera…Medic!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.64,0:10:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,After doing so much to get here, to think that…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.16,0:10:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,it would still end up like this…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.40,0:10:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,From that last play, I could feel your desire to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.08,0:10:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But the way you went about it was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.84,0:10:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have worked hard with your teammates and played an honest game.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.08,0:10:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Spare me. Do you think we didn’t try hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.56,0:10:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If hard work guaranteed a win, would I have ended up like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.76,0:11:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hard work might not always lead to a win, but there are things more important than winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.76,0:11:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We face doubts from others all the time, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.32,0:11:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But we still made it this far through our own efforts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.36,0:11:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how many difficulties we face,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.72,0:11:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,we must strive to overcome them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.28,0:11:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s what makes competitive sports attractive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.56,0:11:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The situation on the court right now is…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.96,0:11:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Vera can no longer compete,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.12,0:11:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,and Team Wolves has no substitute players.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.40,0:11:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Victor?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.76,0:11:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,With no substitutes, doesn’t that mean this year’s champion is—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.04,0:11:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So, in accordance with the competition rules, we announce
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.84,0:11:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,that the champion of this Basketball Game is—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.00,0:11:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That is—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.28,0:12:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Victor! It’s Victor!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.93,0:12:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Victor!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.12,0:12:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I have kept my promise and returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.04,0:12:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Coach, Mr. Slowy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.72,0:12:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.36,0:12:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.60,0:12:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a close call.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.04,0:12:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,—Victor, captain of Team Wolves, has stepped onto the floor just in time.　—Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.00,0:12:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,—Victor! Go, Victor!　—The game resumed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.16,0:12:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Next up…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.40,0:12:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Who will ultimately be the champion?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.08,0:12:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Can the Goat Clan defeat their natural enemy, the Wolf Clan?
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
